This folder is where the deck writes the spell-icon library it slices out of
YOUR OWN Spell Hotbar 2 install, on first launch (src/icon_bridge.cpp).

It ships EMPTY on purpose, and it ships AT ALL on purpose:

  * empty, because Spell Hotbar 2's icon art is not ours to redistribute. The
    deck generates icons/sh/<atlas>/<icon>.png here from the atlases already on
    this machine, and nothing about that library ever leaves it. No Spell
    Hotbar 2 installed = this folder stays empty and the deck uses its built-in
    SVG glyphs, which is a supported, tested state.

  * present, because Mod Organizer 2 fixes the visible file list when the game
    LAUNCHES. A folder that only appears mid-session can be invisible to the
    running view, so it exists up front.

Safe to delete: the next launch sees the missing stamp and rebuilds.
